{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54353","headline":"[拟]送贺秘监会稽诗 · 李慎微","name":"[拟]送贺秘监会稽诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"有客自言狂，经书仕圣唐。\n业尊[傅]（传）帝子，道妙宠君王。\n厌俗怀仙观，思游忆故乡。\n公卿祖疏广，亲戚送刘纲。\n海上波澜急，江干烟路长。\n蓬莱不可见，何处访霓裳。\n（见《会稽掇英总集》卷二）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"李慎微","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_54353.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_54353","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"古风","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}